    <video:video><video:thumbnail_loc>https://zq3s.com/img/ep/al-nassr-al-hilal-part-1-en.jpg</video:thumbnail_loc><video:title>Cristiano Ronaldo &amp; Neymar: Al Nassr vs Al Hilal Followers Before and After the Stars (Part 1)</video:title><video:description>Cristiano Ronaldo&#x27;s arrival post is the most-liked post on the Al Nassr Instagram, with more than 32 million likes. On the Al Hilal Instagram, it&#x27;s the photo announcing Neymar, with more than 10 million. Who gets the credit for those likes, the club or the star? (Likes as counted on 2 November 2026.)</video:description><video:player_loc>https://www.youtube-nocookie.com/embed/Ndv-E7nBdYQ</video:player_loc></video:video>
