    <video:video><video:thumbnail_loc>https://zq3s.com/img/ep/al-nassr-al-hilal-part-2-en.jpg</video:thumbnail_loc><video:title>Cristiano Ronaldo &amp; Neymar: Al Nassr vs Al Hilal, Instagram Likes vs Followers (Part 2)</video:title><video:description>Al Nassr signed Cristiano Ronaldo. Al Hilal signed Neymar, who has since left. In Part 2 the fans get their say: what people wrote in the YouTube comments, and how many Instagram likes each club gets for the size of its following.</video:description><video:player_loc>https://www.youtube-nocookie.com/embed/741axpjwQZw</video:player_loc></video:video>
